                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfalme Rehoboamu akataka shauri kwa wazee, waliosimama mbele ya Sulemani baba yake, alipokuwa hai bado, akasema, Mwanipa shauri gani la kuwajibu watu hawa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
