        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini akaliacha shauri lile la wazee walilompa, akataka shauri kwa wale vijana waliokua pamoja naye, waliosimama mbele yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akawaambia, Je! Mwanipa shauri gani la kuwajibu watu hawa, waliosema nami, wakisema, Utufanyie jepesi kongwa alilotutwika baba yako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na wale vijana waliokua pamoja naye wakamwambia, wakasema, Uwaambie hivi watu wale waliosema nawe, wakinena, Baba yako alilifanya zito kongwa letu, lakini wewe tufanyie jepesi; uwaambie hivi, Kidole changu cha mwisho ni kinene kuliko kiuno cha baba yangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi kama baba yangu aliwatwika kongwa zito, mimi nitaongeza kongwa lenu; baba yangu akiwapiga kwa mijeledi, lakini mimi nitawapiga kwa nge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
