        },
        {
          "text": "Basi mfalme hakuwasikia wale watu; maana jambo hili lilitoka kwa Mungu, ili alithibitishe neno lake alilomwambia Yeroboamu mwana wa Nebati kwa mkono wa Ahiya Mshiloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi Israeli wote walipoona ya kuwa mfalme hawasikilizi, watu wakamjibu mfalme, wakasema, Tuna sehemu gani katika Daudi? Wala hatuna urithi katika mwana wa Yese; nendeni zenu hemani kwenu, enyi Israeli, kila mtu; sasa itunze nyumba yako mwenyewe, Daudi. Basi wakaenda zao Israeli wote hemani kwao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini kwa habari za wana wa Israeli waliokaa katika miji ya Yuda, Rehoboamu alitawala juu yao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo mfalme Rehoboamu akamtuma Adoramu, msimamizi wa shokoa; nao wana wa Israeli wakamtupia mawe, hata akafa. Mfalme Rehoboamu akafanya haraka kupanda garini mwake, ili akimbilie Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
